  "notable_quotes": [
    "In 7–12 Å model channels, C12 diffusion coefficients of 530.4–1218.9 × 10−8 m2/s exceed liquid-phase C12 diffusion of 0.13 × 10−8 m2/s.",
    "Larger pores increase trajectory deviation for long chains, with peak angles rising from 2.0° at 7 Å to 17.0° at 12 Å.",
    "Rapid diffusion occurs when long-chain molecules move linearly along the channel center; this behavior does not exist for short-chain molecules."
